caption: Godhood and Choice

Characters that have an active Godsoul or are a Demon Lord no longer gain experience from marks and are broken free of the Caliber and Class system, requiring that they justify further advantages through play. They can still benefit from normal training and experience loops. Characters that serve a Cosmic Force or Infinitely Powerful Being have a choice in this, but others do not. Here are the following rules for whether you can choose to refuse the Godsoul.

First, if the character is a servant of an IPB or Cosmic Force (not just a worshipper, but someone empowered by an IPB, like me or James), then both Godsoul and Demon Lord are governed by the preferences of that IPB. It may be mandatory, forbidden, or optional, depending on the whims of the greater power.

Second, if the character is a Champion, then they can choose to refuse the Demon Seed or Godsoul and remain a champion of the divinity that empowered them. This is the case that all of the rest of the PCs fall into: we are all currently Champions of Pentacle.

Finally, if a character is neither a servent of an IPB/Cosmic Force nor a Champion, then Godhood or Demon Lord status is not optional. They become the thing as soon as they qualify.
